ACPI video brightness keys.

Kernel driver installs a notify handler on devices that have _BCL
(for example \_SB_.PCI0.GFX0.LCD_). On 0x86/0x87 it publishes
/dev/power/acpi_video/0.

Userspace helper waits on that device and calls screenmode -b.

Overlay path:
~/config/non-packaged/add-ons/kernel/drivers/power/acpi_video

Not Gerrit yet.
